%description:
Tests the text of a SYN without Fast Open (RFC 9293 LISTEN: "any other control
or text should be queued for processing later"). The client sends 200 bytes on
its SYN without a cookie (fastopenClientNoCookieRequired), and the server has no
Fast Open, so its SYN-ACK acknowledges only the SYN. The client sends a bare
ACK and then the data, which the tester deletes. The server queued the text at
SEG.SEQ+1, so at ESTABLISHED it delivers the 200 bytes and acknowledges 201.
Master queued the text one octet too early and never delivered it, so the
client had to send the data again after its RTO.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 10s
*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tSend=0s
*.cli_app.sendBytes=200B
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientNoCookieRequired = true
*.cli_tcp.sendDataWithFirstAck = false
*.tcptester.script="A3 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:200(200) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
[0.005 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:201(200) ack 501 win 16384 # deleting
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[0.207 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 201 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Processing the text of the SYN: 200 bytes
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
TcpTestNet1.srv_app: received 200 bytes in 1 packets
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
